# --- 环境与缓存 ---
**/.venv
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/*.egg-info/
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

